<title>SWEDEN: Single bidder sweeps Swedish 5-yr bond auction.</title>
<headline>Single bidder sweeps Swedish 5-yr bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of two billion crowns of five-year bonds was 6.47 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A single bidder took the entire auction.</p>
<p>						Loan 1039</p>
<p>Volume issued (millions)		2,000</p>
<p>Total bids    (millions)		4,600</p>
<p>Number of accepted bids		     1</p>
<p>Number of bids				 46</p>
<p>Lowest yields			     6.469</p>
<p>Highest yields			    6.469</p>
<p>Weighted average yield		  6.469</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
